  "instructions": [
    "Heat the yuzu-cured olive oil in a tagine over medium heat.",
    "Add the ginger and cook until fragrant, about 1 minute.",
    "Add the mixed herbs, smoked paprika, garlic, carrots, and yams. Cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the fenugreek leaves and cook until wilted.",
    "Pour in the lime juice and honey, and stir to combine.",
    "Season with black pepper and salt to taste.",
    "Bring the tagine to a simmer and cook for an additional 10 minutes or until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Garnish with fresh parsley and serve hot.",
    "Let the tagine rest for 5 minutes before serving to allow the flavors to meld together."
  ],
